WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.910
Picture a concert ticket
you'd happily pay 15 for.

2
00:00:03.910 --> 00:00:06.440
The price printed on it is only 10.

3
00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:08.320
That leaves a gap of 5.

4
00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:11.170
And the seller might have
accepted less than 10.

5
00:00:11.170 --> 00:00:14.960
Now multiply that by every
buyer and seller in a market.

6
00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:17.430
When you'd gladly pay more than the price,

7
00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:19.550
where does that extra value go?

8
00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:23.050
In this mission, you'll hunt for
those gaps on a supply and demand

9
00:00:23.050 --> 00:00:26.520
graph, on the buyers' side
and the sellers' side.

10
00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:31.020
Then you'll shift demand and predict
what happens to buyers and sellers.

11
00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:34.590
Your mission: track down
where that extra value goes.
